{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_153_synopsis", "source_sha256": "abe02b13243d82b662646b30e4ee32df5981822db861929431117388b8b79456", "ja": "仕事での失敗を機に両親からアイドルを辞め\nるよう勧められた可憐は、自分がアイドルで\nいたいと思う理由を探し始め、やがて自分を\n心配する他のアイドル達の言動の中に、自分\nの中にもある答えを見出すのだった。", "zh": "可怜因为工作上的失误而被父母劝说放弃做\n偶像，于是她开始寻找自己想继续当偶像的\n理由，并最终在关心自己的其他偶像们的一言\n一行中，找到了自己心中本就拥有的答案。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_153_1000_045kar", "source_sha256": "cf976809a76c9fd28b99ceda32600801bf5ec7ced8115c30c160a653ead88068", "ja": "今歌ったのは、新曲の『勇気のfragrance』\nという曲です。その……みなさん、どうでしたか？", "zh": "刚才演唱的是新歌《勇气的fragrance》。那个……大家觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_153_1001_audience", "source_sha256": "ded309b31cb70e29e6c2bfe94427d99db37a028973e85a8d06b5c4a996e46f0c", "ja": "ワアアアアアッ！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_153_1002_045kar", "source_sha256": "73fcbfb2618d0295959332c4b6864bffdecce621eb6ea87ea3bbd1ef3c49fdea", "ja": "あ、ありがとうございます……。\nううっ。し、新曲は、やっぱり緊張しますね……。", "zh": "啊，谢谢大家……  \n呜呜，新、新歌果然还是会让人紧张呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_153_1003_045kar", "source_sha256": "15e2498fc6d03dadc7a7fca80f8b827d03737f561f30c880108baa8711c21036", "ja": "でも……こうして、みなさんの笑顔が見られて……\n少しは、ちゃんと歌えたのかなって、思ってます……。", "zh": "不过……能像这样看到大家的笑容……\n我想，自己应该也算是好好唱出来了一点……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_153_1004_045kar", "source_sha256": "f516049f25dd8f403099ff52a9a1bf462317357029bc7106da0761bba23d314d", "ja": "わ、私も『勇気のfragrance』で、いられるように\n……これからも、アイドル、がんばりますね……っ！", "zh": "我、我也会继续努力，成为《勇气的fragrance》……才对，继续当好偶像……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_153_1005_audience", "source_sha256": "7f5560e1d7b2a24bf40e361d8c94ed8001b8f0a744c7768547eaa0b313629783", "ja": "ワアアアアアーーーーーッ！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊————！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_153_1006_045kar", "source_sha256": "b529a7552303a07cfe6f3187cf0d7eefbb82cd63d0e93b982a98b23bdcbf405c", "ja": "ふぅ……あっ、{$P$}さん！\nお疲れ様でした……♪", "zh": "呼……啊，{$P$}先生！\n辛苦了……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_153_1007_p", "source_sha256": "54a7d7581926a1eb762deb8673502b03e86feca6c52482e9497a238f4fbb17c2", "ja": "お疲れ様、可憐。\n文句なし！　すごくいいステージだったよ！", "zh": "辛苦了，可怜。\n无可挑剔！这场演出非常精彩！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_153_1008_045kar", "source_sha256": "3631d03bc042fbc88b25c4849fac92355ad1f9f9b038a4238949d7c6f2a251bb", "ja": "ほ、本当ですか？\nよかったぁ……。てへ。", "zh": "真、真的吗？\n太好了……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_153_1009_035hin", "source_sha256": "6bdb9a90eeaf2135988568b28ebdaf54d69553f67459d16ed5b119ea9909a8c2", "ja": "お疲れさまだよぉ。可憐さんの歌を聞いてたら\nあたしも心がポカポカになったよぉ。", "zh": "辛苦啦。听了可怜的歌，我的心也变得暖乎乎的啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_153_1010_004yuk", "source_sha256": "fa083e2e7ffd52ccb34e1f1668fa1f5bdbdc991f0b0440130d6d885141a37272", "ja": "お、お疲れ様ー！　ぐすっ、とっても素敵だったよ！\nわた……私……ううっ、感動しちゃって……！", "zh": "呜、辛苦了——！吸，真的太棒了！我……我……呜呜，感动得……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_153_1011_040tam", "source_sha256": "97ab47e8258d96e68780c98eeb23b972c6fc926f5b8403f2e62b2bab4c6b34a1", "ja": "ゆ、雪歩お姉ちゃん！？\nえっと……タオルタオル～……タオルがないぞ～！", "zh": "雪、雪步姐姐！？\n那个……毛巾毛巾～……没有毛巾啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_153_1012_011ami", "source_sha256": "9a255bde37c8a1964bf799462800520315e41efdef33944fa84e3b11edb0e0b1", "ja": "よーし、たまきち勝負だー！\nどっちが早くタオルを持ってくるか……ヨイドンッ！", "zh": "好——环，来比一场吧！\n看谁先把毛巾拿过来……预备——跑！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_153_1013_040tam", "source_sha256": "802295cf9053d74c91c641604607c402938fdc8a2a33ac7bf9a2016d12ef7bf8", "ja": "ええっ！？\nズルいぞ、あみ～！　待ってよ～！", "zh": "诶！？  \n太狡猾了，亚美～！等等我呀～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_153_1014_p", "source_sha256": "a20201d4a7752569d7edf4f0c1e5e1cddc396989e702e4e00a848fd6db3d5b70", "ja": "おーい、廊下を走ると危ないぞ！\nって、聞いてないな。まったく……。", "zh": "喂——在走廊里跑很危险啊！\n真是的，根本没听进去……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_153_1015_p", "source_sha256": "7b68656c0b38a83d223594bcba68096d070891d0ae6a31d5c82afd7da3b7c621", "ja": "うーん……タオルの到着を待つより、\nこのまま控え室に向かった方が早そうだ。", "zh": "嗯……与其等毛巾送到，还是直接去休息室比较快。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_153_1016_004yuk", "source_sha256": "ef02fcf92d90815cf5ea465fd952bffc6c316e6fcdfb5b1c25d1d7095788558e", "ja": "ぐすっ……そうですね……。\n着替えもしないといけないし、先に戻ろうかな。", "zh": "呜呜……是啊……\n还得换衣服，还是先回去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_153_1017_035hin", "source_sha256": "bef48410e01b67ab7efeefe562e48e58cc6e759092be96842e21e5b07719b03b", "ja": "そうだねぇ。亜美シショーや環ちゃんと\n途中で会えるといいんだけども……。", "zh": "是呀。要是能在路上遇到亚美师父和环就好了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
