{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_153_1019_045kar", "source_sha256": "086d9a649df8b9142cef11af4f18f8f9226a5cb7b6051d1a3f73e260fb685c9b", "ja": "あの……、{$P$}さん……。", "zh": "那个……，{$P$}先生……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_153_1020_045kar", "source_sha256": "4ccc44541ff29f14f8b9d42a18674d2dcafc8d83a2e0cbb08dcecc73ebdc8fcf", "ja": "私、これからも、みんなみたいに、誰かの力に……\n誰かの勇気に、なりたいです……。", "zh": "我……今后也想像大家一样，成为某个人的力量……\n成为某个人的勇气……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_153_1021_045kar", "source_sha256": "e384ea54b7dbfef0f88cfab616dcdb24e7b5c39346129bce428e04b42cb705a8", "ja": "な、なんて、自分の勇気も足りないのにって、自分でも\n思うんですけど……みんなを見てると、そんな風に……", "zh": "可、可是，明明连自己的勇气都还不够，我自己也会这么想……可是看到大家，就会觉得自己也想那样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_153_1022_p", "source_sha256": "af01931590895a2d4ffb325be045f2475d7c42d9d7e75f12d64ff993032c7003", "ja": "可憐ならできる。……いや、できてるよ。\n今も可憐から、たくさん勇気をもらえたし。", "zh": "可怜的话肯定能做到的。……不，你其实已经做到了。\n刚才我也从可怜这里，获得了许多勇气。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_153_1023_045kar", "source_sha256": "78a76d4d9c48ca1995212ba15af8e7a4da165899ca9d93a75d2bfd379d0f4c00", "ja": "あっ。そ、そんな……。", "zh": "啊。没、没有那回事……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_153_1024_045kar", "source_sha256": "f3d5a193a04680a0dc11a38a1c9ced084e09ad08f476a3b8b04b7b32a0ec5575", "ja": "っ、{$P$}さんこそ……\nいつも私に、勇気をくれます……♪　てへへ。", "zh": "呃，{$P$}先生才是……\n一直都在给予我勇气……♪ 嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_153_1025_045kar", "source_sha256": "3369dcc874964d6352197d8bf5b470a03d23fc7dcf5e0f920bcd0b4cd073d0e8", "ja": "わ、私も……ちゃんと勇気を出して……。", "zh": "我、我也要……好好拿出勇气来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
